{"seq":26,"slug":"svelte-compiler-frameworks","title":"Svelte 与编译式框架","stage":"DONE","category":"frontend","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/frontend/svelte-compiler-frameworks","rating":{"composite":3.94,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# Svelte 与编译式框架\n\n主流前端框架长期把「框架运行时」当成必需品：React、Vue 把一份 diff 算法、调度器、组件实例管理打包进浏览器，运行时再凭这套机器去比对虚拟 DOM、决定哪里需要更新。Svelte 走的是另一条路——把这些工作提前到构建期，由编译器把声明式的组件代码翻译成直接操作 DOM 的命令式 JavaScript，浏览器里几乎不再需要框架本身。这就是「编译式框架」的核心立场：用编译期的智能换取运行期的精简。\n\n这个 hub 按四章层层递进，目标是让一个有几年经验的开发者既理解理念、又能落地工程。\n\n第一章「基础」打地基：先讲清编译式框架到底在主张什么、它和运行时框架的取舍边界在哪，再回溯 Svelte 4 时代基于赋值与 `$:` 的旧响应式如何工作、又为何在大型应用里逐渐失灵，最后落到 Svelte 5 的 Runes——一套显式的、信号驱动的响应式原语。理解了 Runes，后面所有内容才有支点。\n\n第二章「组件」讲构建单元：`.svelte` 文件的结构与模板语法、snippet 取代 slot 的新组合方式、store 与 Runes 在跨组件状态上的分工，以及属性传递与事件回调在 Svelte 5 里如何统一到标准 DOM 属性与回调 prop 上。\n\n第三章「全栈」上升到应用层：SvelteKit 如何把路由、服务端渲染、表单动作、远程函数与一键部署整合成一个全栈框架，文件式路由与 `load` 数据加载怎样组织数据流，以及 SSR、SSG、CSR 三种渲染模式如何按页面取舍。\n\n第四章「对比与生态」收口：把 Svelte 放回更大的框架图景里——对照 React/Vue 的虚拟 DOM 范式、用真实基准与包体积数据衡量编译式路线的收益与代价，最后落到 SolidJS 这个把细粒度响应做到极致的同道者，看清「编译器 vs 运行时」两条技术路线如何在信号上殊途同归。\n\n四章读完，你会得到一条完整的认知链：从「为什么不要运行时」这一理念，到 Runes 这一机制，再到 SvelteKit 这一工程载体，最后回到与整个生态的横向坐标。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/h/frontend/svelte-compiler-frameworks/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"compiler-framework-concept","title":"编译式框架的理念","url":"/h/frontend/svelte-compiler-frameworks/foundations/compiler-framework-concept"},{"seq":2,"slug":"svelte-reactivity","title":"Svelte 响应式","url":"/h/frontend/svelte-compiler-frameworks/foundations/svelte-reactivity"},{"seq":3,"slug":"runes","title":"Runes 响应式系统","url":"/h/frontend/svelte-compiler-frameworks/foundations/runes"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"components","title":"组件","docCount":3,"url":"/h/frontend/svelte-compiler-frameworks/components","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"component-model","title":"组件模型","url":"/h/frontend/svelte-compiler-frameworks/components/component-model"},{"seq":2,"slug":"stores-state","title":"Store 与状态","url":"/h/frontend/svelte-compiler-frameworks/components/stores-state"},{"seq":3,"slug":"props-events","title":"属性与事件","url":"/h/frontend/svelte-compiler-frameworks/components/props-events"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"fullstack","title":"全栈","docCount":3,"url":"/h/frontend/svelte-compiler-frameworks/fullstack","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"sveltekit","title":"SvelteKit 全栈框架","url":"/h/frontend/svelte-compiler-frameworks/fullstack/sveltekit"},{"seq":2,"slug":"routing-loading","title":"路由与数据加载","url":"/h/frontend/svelte-compiler-frameworks/fullstack/routing-loading"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ssr-ssg","title":"SSR 与 SSG","url":"/h/frontend/svelte-compiler-frameworks/fullstack/ssr-ssg"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"comparison","title":"对比与生态","docCount":3,"url":"/h/frontend/svelte-compiler-frameworks/comparison","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"vs-virtual-dom","title":"对比虚拟 DOM 框架","url":"/h/frontend/svelte-compiler-frameworks/comparison/vs-virtual-dom"},{"seq":2,"slug":"performance-bundle","title":"性能与包体积","url":"/h/frontend/svelte-compiler-frameworks/comparison/performance-bundle"},{"seq":3,"slug":"solidjs-signals","title":"SolidJS 与细粒度响应","url":"/h/frontend/svelte-compiler-frameworks/comparison/solidjs-signals"}]}]}